@baseUrl = https://localhost:7217

### Get all conferences

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conferences


### Create a conference

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ConferenceProFlow Summit 2027",
  "startsAtUtc": "2027-06-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endsAtUtc": "2027-06-02T18:00:00Z"
}


### Get a conference by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conferences/REPLACE_WITH_CONFERENCE_ID


### Create a conference session

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conferences/REPLACE_WITH_CONFERENCE_ID/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Building Distributed Systems with .NET",
  "startsAtUtc": "2027-06-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endsAtUtc": "2027-06-01T11:30:00Z"
}


### Get conference sessions

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conferences/REPLACE_WITH_CONFERENCE_ID/sessions